      "en": "He made an effort to become a professional golfer, but he made ( ) progress.",
      "options": ["① a few", "② few", "③ a little", "④ little"],
      "q_type": "multiple_choice",
      "ja": "彼はプロゴルファーになるために努力したが、ほとんど上達しなかった。",
