      "number": "703",
      "level": "standard",
      "is_frequent": true,
      "en": "It is hard to believe that (a year and half / a year and a half) have passed since the last time our whole family got together.",
      "q_type": "error_correction",
      "ja": "私たち家族全員が最後に集まってから、1年半が過ぎたなんて信じがたい。",
